WEBVTT

00:00:29.776 --> 00:00:33.362
And while I'm sure
that every caring parent

00:00:33.404 --> 00:00:36.741
wants those same things
for their children,

00:00:36.783 --> 00:00:39.577
I think we're going about it
the wrong way.

00:00:40.995 --> 00:00:44.415
We want our kids
to be happy and successful.

00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:50.838
So our instinct is to shield them
from hurt and disappointment.

00:00:52.507 --> 00:00:57.053
We worry about their self-esteem,
so we praise them for everything.

00:00:58.054 --> 00:01:02.266
We are concerned about whether
or not they fit in,